# Code owners, read by GitHub from the pull request's base branch, so a pull request cannot change who owns its own
# changes. The last matching pattern wins. Every RedSalamanders repository has this same file.

# CI: the workflows, this file, and every script that decides what CI runs, measures or passes. The workflows and
# the Dependabot configuration are also named on their own lines, which repository policy tests look for.
/.github/                  @eric-jesover
/.github/workflows/        @eric-jesover
/.github/dependabot.yml    @eric-jesover
/.ci/                      @eric-jesover
/Tests/                    @eric-jesover
/Tools/                    @eric-jesover
/Build/                    @eric-jesover
/*.ps1                     @eric-jesover
/Directory.Build.*         @eric-jesover

# Agent instructions.
/.agents/                  @eric-jesover
/.claude/                  @eric-jesover
/AGENTS.md                 @eric-jesover
/CLAUDE.md                 @eric-jesover
